    "Text recognition": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Texterkennung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text recognition below ran on this iPhone. Connect your Fixify server in Settings to get a diagnosis and a guided plan.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Texterkennung unten lief auf diesem iPhone. Verbinde deinen Fixify-Server in den Einstellungen, um eine Diagnose und einen geführten Plan zu erhalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text recognition works on this iPhone. For full analyses, connect your Fixify server in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Texterkennung funktioniert auf diesem iPhone. Für vollständige Analysen verbinde deinen Fixify-Server in den Einstellungen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text recognition, on-device analysis": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Texterkennung, Analyse auf dem Gerät"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text recognized on this iPhone": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf diesem iPhone erkannter Text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI declined to analyze this. Try a different photo or description.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die KI hat die Analyse abgelehnt. Versuch es mit einem anderen Foto oder einer anderen Beschreibung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The App Store could not be reached.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der App Store ist nicht erreichbar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Claude key stays on your server. The app only stores an app token in the Keychain.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Claude-Schlüssel bleibt auf deinem Server. Die App speichert nur ein App-Token im Schlüsselbund."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Fixify server can't be reached. Check that it is running and that your iPhone is on the same network.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Fixify-Server ist nicht erreichbar. Prüfe, ob er läuft und ob dein iPhone im selben Netzwerk ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The analysis came back in an unexpected format, so it is not shown. (%@)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Analyse kam in einem unerwarteten Format zurück und wird daher nicht angezeigt. (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The analysis separates what is visible from what is guessed, lists possible causes and says what is still unknown.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Analyse trennt Sichtbares von Vermutetem, nennt mögliche Ursachen und sagt, was noch unbekannt ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The analysis took too long. Try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Analyse hat zu lange gedauert. Versuch es noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The analysis, steps, history and photos of this session are removed from this iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Analyse, Schritte, Verlauf und Fotos dieser Session werden von diesem iPhone entfernt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current plan doesn't know about it yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der aktuelle Plan berücksichtigt sie noch nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image could not be saved.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Bild konnte nicht gespeichert werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The on-device model could not complete this analysis. Try a shorter description or use the Fixify server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das On-Device-Modell konnte die Analyse nicht abschließen. Versuch eine kürzere Beschreibung oder nutze den Fixify-Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The on-device model is still downloading. Try again later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das On-Device-Modell wird noch geladen. Versuch es später erneut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The on-device model reads the recognized text and your description. It cannot see the photo itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das On-Device-Modell liest den erkannten Text und deine Beschreibung. Das Foto selbst sieht es nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photo could not be taken. Try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Foto konnte nicht aufgenommen werden. Versuch es noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The purchase could not be verified.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Kauf konnte nicht bestätigt werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server is limiting requests. Try again in %lld seconds.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Server begrenzt Anfragen. Versuch es in %lld Sekunden erneut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server is limiting requests. Try again later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Server begrenzt Anfragen. Versuch es später erneut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server rejected the app token. Copy the token from the server window into Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Server hat das App-Token abgelehnt. Kopiere das Token aus dem Server-Fenster in die Einstellungen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server reported an error (%lld).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Server meldet einen Fehler (%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The window shows a server address and an app token.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Fenster zeigt eine Server-Adresse und ein App-Token."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then put your Anthropic API key into server/.env as ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trage dann deinen Anthropic-API-Schlüssel in server/.env als ANTHROPIC_API_KEY ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They go to the Fixify server you configured, which sends them to Anthropic's Claude to create the analysis. Nothing is sent in the background. Avoid photographing passwords, IDs or other people.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie gehen an den von dir eingerichteten Fixify-Server, der sie an Claude von Anthropic sendet, um die Analyse zu erstellen. Im Hintergrund wird nichts gesendet. Fotografiere möglichst keine Passwörter, Ausweise oder andere Personen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone does not support Apple Intelligence.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses iPhone unterstützt Apple Intelligence nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This session reached the %lld free plan updates. Pro allows longer, connected troubleshooting.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Session hat die %lld kostenlosen Plan-Aktualisierungen erreicht. Mit Pro sind längere, zusammenhängende Fehlersuchen möglich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tick only what you have actually tested.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
